docs {
  # Get ASH Tracking Detail
  
  Retrieves the full detail of a single ASH termly tracking record by its unique identifier.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                              |
  |-----------|--------|----------|------------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the termly tracking record       |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the complete ASH termly tracking record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": {
      "firstName": "string",
      "surname": "string",
      "id": "uuid",
      "studentId": "uuid",
      "academicSession": "2025/26",
      "term": "string",
      "schoolName": "string",
      "schoolNumeracyScore": 80.5 | null,
      "schoolLiteracyScore": 75.0 | null,
      "schoolAverage": 77.5 | null,
      "schoolPosition": "string" | null,
      "pretestNumeracyScore": 60.0 | null,
      "pretestLiteracyScore": 55.0 | null,
      "pretestAverage": 57.5 | null,
      "midtestNumeracyScore": 70.0 | null,
      "midtestLiteracyScore": 65.0 | null,
      "midtestAverage": 67.5 | null,
      "posttestNumeracyScore": 85.0 | null,
      "posttestLiteracyScore": 80.0 | null,
      "posttestAverage": 82.5 | null,
      "termResultUrl": "string",
      "termResultPublicId": "string",
      "disciplineRating": 4,
      "responsibilityRating": 3,
      "leadershipRating": 5,
      "notableAchievements": "string" | null,
      "challengesObserved": "string" | null,
      "nextTermRecommendations": "string" | null,
      "mentorName": "string",
      "updatedAt": "ISO 8601" | null,
      "createdAt": "ISO 8601",
      "deletedAt": "ISO 8601" | null
    },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### Response Fields (`data`)
  
  | Field                      | Type   | Description                                                    |
  |----------------------------|--------|----------------------------------------------------------------|
  | firstName                  | string | Student's first name (joined from ASH student record).         |
  | surname                    | string | Student's surname (joined from ASH student record).            |
  | id                         | string | UUID primary key of the tracking record.                       |
  | studentId                  | string | UUID reference to the ASH student record.                      |
  | academicSession            | string | Academic session (e.g. `2025/26`).                             |
  | term                       | string | Academic term.                                                 |
  | schoolName                 | string | Name of the school.                                            |
  | schoolNumeracyScore        | number | Numeracy score from school (nullable).                         |
  | schoolLiteracyScore        | number | Literacy score from school (nullable).                         |
  | schoolAverage              | number | School average score (nullable).                               |
  | schoolPosition             | string | Position in school (nullable).                                 |
  | pretestNumeracyScore       | number | Pre-test numeracy score (nullable).                            |
  | pretestLiteracyScore       | number | Pre-test literacy score (nullable).                            |
  | pretestAverage             | number | Pre-test average score (nullable).                             |
  | midtestNumeracyScore       | number | Mid-test numeracy score (nullable).                            |
  | midtestLiteracyScore       | number | Mid-test literacy score (nullable).                            |
  | midtestAverage             | number | Mid-test average score (nullable).                             |
  | posttestNumeracyScore      | number | Post-test numeracy score (nullable).                           |
  | posttestLiteracyScore      | number | Post-test literacy score (nullable).                           |
  | posttestAverage            | number | Post-test average score (nullable).                            |
  | termResultUrl              | string | URL of the term result document.                               |
  | termResultPublicId         | string | Cloudinary public ID for the term result.                      |
  | disciplineRating           | number | Discipline rating (1–5).                                       |
  | responsibilityRating       | number | Responsibility rating (1–5).                                   |
  | leadershipRating           | number | Leadership rating (1–5).                                       |
  | notableAchievements        | string | Notable achievements during the term (nullable).               |
  | challengesObserved         | string | Challenges observed during the term (nullable).                |
  | nextTermRecommendations    | string | Recommendations for the next term (nullable).                  |
  | mentorName                 | string | Name of the assigned mentor.                                   |
  | updatedAt                  | string | ISO 8601 timestamp of last update (nullable).                  |
  | createdAt                  | string | ISO 8601 timestamp of record creation.                         |
  | deletedAt                  | string | ISO 8601 soft-delete timestamp (nullable).                     |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                        |
  |-----------------------------|----------------------------------------------------
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).        |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                           |
}
